05:26.620 --> 05:31.820
The paper formally defines an object not as a single state, but as a pair.

05:32.340 --> 05:37.620
You have X, the current configuration, and you have C of X, which is the set of all admissible continuations.

05:38.400 --> 05:40.760
Let me make sure I'm wrapping my head around admissible continuations.

05:40.900 --> 05:42.820
We are talking about the possible futures, right?

05:42.900 --> 05:43.880
Yes, exactly.

05:43.880 --> 05:47.900
The things that are allowed to happen next to this configuration without breaking its fundamental nature.

05:48.120 --> 05:50.340
The entity is the continuation structure.

05:50.840 --> 05:54.120
The physical matter merely realizes that structure temporarily.

05:54.120 --> 05:57.540
The data or information merely describes it.

05:57.960 --> 06:00.420
The true thing is the bundle of futures.

06:00.800 --> 06:01.400
Mind-blowing.

06:01.860 --> 06:07.640
And this leads us directly to a core mathematical apparatus, the paper constructs, called a distinction bundle.

06:08.320 --> 06:12.020
Imagine a base manifold which we will designate with the letter M.

06:12.280 --> 06:12.520
Okay.

06:12.520 --> 06:20.340
In geometry, a manifold is a space that locally resembles flat space, but globally might be curved or complex.

06:20.900 --> 06:24.420
For our purposes, this manifold M represents history itself.

06:24.680 --> 06:31.360
It could be continuous physical time or a sequence of computational steps or the evolving state of a human conversation.

06:31.360 --> 06:31.960
Got it.

06:32.160 --> 06:38.360
A single point on this manifold, let's call it P, represents one highly specific historical context.

06:38.360 --> 06:40.380
Okay, let me visualize this.

06:40.980 --> 06:47.540
If M, the manifold, is a sprawling landscape representing an entire two-hour conversation between two people,

06:48.220 --> 06:51.800
then point P is a specific set of coordinates on that landscape.

06:51.960 --> 06:52.220
Exactly.

06:52.360 --> 06:56.300
Like, say, the exact fleeting moment where someone finishes a sentence and takes a breath.

06:56.400 --> 06:58.340
That is a highly accurate visualization.

06:58.860 --> 07:05.980
Now, picture that hanging vertically above every single point P on this landscape is a mathematical fiber designated as E sub P.

07:06.040 --> 07:06.440
A fiber.

07:06.440 --> 07:12.880
This fiber contains all the distinctions, all the differences that are available and relevant at that specific historical location P.

07:13.240 --> 07:20.860
The entire apparatus together, the base landscape of history, and the infinite forest of vertical fibers hanging above it is the distinction bundle.

07:21.140 --> 07:21.660
Wait, hold on.

