08:36.440 --> 08:42.600
The distinction fiber, E sub P, is Flyxion's mathematical formalization of Bateson's concept.

08:43.200 --> 08:46.840
The fiber does not hold every theoretically measurable difference.

08:47.240 --> 08:49.540
