09:42.540 --> 09:42.840
Exactly.

09:43.080 --> 09:52.080
Because the constitutive distinction, the core operational ability to seamlessly connect a customer with a product or a digital service, continued.

09:52.080 --> 09:59.140
The continuation space of that specific market interaction survived, even though the raw material of the company completely turned over.

09:59.140 --> 10:04.960
That analogy highlights the core mechanism perfectly because it decouples identity from physical continuity.

10:05.660 --> 10:09.640
The identity of the corporate entity is not its state equality over time.

