how do we mathematically move that bundle forward through time?

12:20.560 --> 12:21.120
Yeah.

12:21.180 --> 12:21.880
How does it travel?

12:22.060 --> 12:22.560
Exactly.

12:22.880 --> 12:29.980
How do we transport these fragile distinctions from point A to point B on our manifold of history without them falling apart?

