Even if you exist in a space that seems perfectly flat and normal locally, if you take a journey around a closed loop, say, you leave your hometown, go on a long, complicated journey across the world, and physically return to the exact same GPS coordinates of your childhood bedroom, you might find that your internal state, your continuation space, is completely altered.

16:13.920 --> 16:14.380
Exactly.

